IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `tsba-bombings`

-- Terrorism (Suppression of Bombings) Act 2007, ss 2 to 8 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_terrorism-suppression-of-bombings-act-2007.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- devices and targets`

`a pipe bomb` MEANS Device WITH
    `is an explosive or incendiary weapon or device` IS TRUE
    `works by releasing toxic chemicals, biological agents or toxins` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing radiation or radioactive material` IS FALSE
    `is designed or capable to cause death, serious injury or substantial damage` IS TRUE

`a sarin dispersal device` MEANS Device WITH
    `is an explosive or incendiary weapon or device` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing toxic chemicals, biological agents or toxins` IS TRUE
    `works by releasing radiation or radioactive material` IS FALSE
    `is designed or capable to cause death, serious injury or substantial damage` IS TRUE

`a dirty bomb` MEANS Device WITH
    `is an explosive or incendiary weapon or device` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing toxic chemicals, biological agents or toxins` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing radiation or radioactive material` IS TRUE
    `is designed or capable to cause death, serious injury or substantial damage` IS TRUE

`a party popper` MEANS Device WITH
    `is an explosive or incendiary weapon or device` IS TRUE
    `works by releasing toxic chemicals, biological agents or toxins` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing radiation or radioactive material` IS FALSE
    `is designed or capable to cause death, serious injury or substantial damage` IS FALSE

`a heavy hammer` MEANS Device WITH
    `is an explosive or incendiary weapon or device` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing toxic chemicals, biological agents or toxins` IS FALSE
    `works by releasing radiation or radioactive material` IS FALSE
    `is designed or capable to cause death, serious injury or substantial damage` IS TRUE

