§ `s 3 -- terrorist bombing`

`a mall bomb meant to kill that kills no one` MEANS Bombing WITH
    `the actor` IS `a private individual`
    `the device` IS `a pipe bomb`
    `the target` IS `a shopping mall open to the public`
    `delivered, placed, discharged or detonated it` IS TRUE
    `did so intentionally` IS TRUE
    `had a lawful excuse` IS FALSE
    `intended death or serious bodily injury` IS TRUE
    `intended extensive destruction of the target` IS FALSE
    `the destruction results or is likely to result in major economic loss` IS FALSE
    `death was caused` IS FALSE
    `by armed forces in a conflict governed by international humanitarian law` IS FALSE
